oard row (`render_project_tile_html`) and project header **read the cache only** â€” no synchronous model run on render; generation runs in the background on `rescan`.\n\n**Wave 3 â€” outcome (GREEN, 2026-06-14)**\n- Marked **GREEN**; verified `pytest` green and the cache-only render path (proven by a stub-counter).\n- A mid-build user request â€” *\"project-window changes should reflect on the main dashboard timely\"* â€” was **folded into this wave** because it touches the same dashboard-row/summary render path.\n- PART 1: `summarizer.project_extraction_seed` adds per-lane activity; `_project_seed_prompt` rewritten to ask for a grounded 1â€“2 sentence **Objective**; `render_project_markdown` emits a prose `## Objective`; the project header renders the cached `Objective:` line.\n- PART 2 (folded): a read-only `GET /api/...` endpoint (anchor truncated) re-renders dashboard rows for timely in-place reflection.\n\n---\n*Grounding note:* claims are drawn from the three member documents (Master Plan, Implementation Plan, Execution Log). Two anchors (the locked past-session-view decision and the Wave 3 PART 2 endpoint) are **truncated in the source excerpts**, so their full detail is stated only as far as the member text grounds it."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4412,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":55814,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6c6eac34-cfec-40df-8069-b18a56e09205","uuid":"ce7624a5-c0ab-4869-955c-bb969669ce7b","request_id":"req_011Cc52tedC4EBtioddVCXKX"}
